  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/heygen-com/hyperframes/zipball/v0.8.206",
  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.8.206\n\nReleased on 2026-10-26.\n\nScrubbing a long film in Studio costs less, and a composition with no timeline script no longer waits 45 seconds before it renders. Preview and render also agree on the video frame and on a PNG colours, and HEIC photos now work in compositions.\n\n## Features\n\n- **CLI:** Check catches audio the render would lose or play as silence ([d83bf997b0b6b](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/d83bf997b0b6bf073a3c764c701eb1d1819104df), [#6439](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6439)).\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Render:** A PNG's colour tags no longer change its pixels in preview, check, snapshot or render ([3e16603d3769d](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/3e16603d3769d6637ee315f50d4c2c431f57eb8e), [#6453](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6453)).\n- **Core:** Paused preview and render show the same, correct video frame ([e3e93aa7fe14a](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/e3e93aa7fe14a8bfbc737069096369ed53409a27), [#6432](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6432)).\n- **Producer:** A composition with no timeline-registering script no longer waits 45 s at setup ([4a5ee736143aa](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/4a5ee736143aa33fb366260671c48ce597757836), [#6436](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6436)).\n- **CLI:** A killed CLI no longer leaves its child processes running ([5148326fd6632](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/5148326fd6632a919d89649d3e7a81b8af742560), [#6431](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6431)).\n- **Snapshot:** Video frames keep the colours render gives the same footage ([37f14fdcb12ae](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/37f14fdcb12aeea8ec39cc6bce8c6a338ceca54f), [#6425](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6425)).\n- **Producer:** Convert HEIC images to JPEG at compile time ([ad4d3fad13949](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/ad4d3fad139490104f5bbeba66a2892c609e37fc), [#6455](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6455)).\n- **CLI:** Hide the Windows console for the port lookup and clipboard ([37543d223a535](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/37543d223a5356fff27f29a6d1c184adaa604baf), [#6449](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6449)).\n- **Core:** A composition behind a wrapper takes its host's start ([0979e32a8dd7c](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/0979e32a8dd7cbf951829ce7fb6298528aba5c9a), [#6435](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6435)).\n- **CLI:** Validate play and present ports ([0cc14ddb8ec1a](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/0cc14ddb8ec1aee20c1d846c6435eefd8e9f2491), [#6402](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6402)).\n- **Engine:** Name the element a failing root composition script looked up ([83a29e9209df8](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/83a29e9209df83937851f435989a0f7c251a169b), [#6430](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6430)).\n\n## Performance\n\n- **Studio:** A scrub's state messages re-read the preview's compositions at most every 500 ms ([121bf20e99da6](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/121bf20e99da6c514d7ae0a0fe166c4a12ae7209), [#6429](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6429)).\n- **Studio:** The layer walk keeps its selector index, so scrubbing into new scenes is cheaper ([f1b5d89a1ea74](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/f1b5d89a1ea74f2c27b46808c8f416ed704d3998), [#6427](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6427)).\n\n## Docs & Examples\n\n- **Changelog:** Weekly digest 2026-10-19-2026-10-26 ([c9e86a3b01199](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/c9e86a3b01199e78b4907667e63b330e9d742004), [#6447](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6447)).\n\n## Internal\n\n- **Lint:** Cover three caption rules that had no tests ([95aba51e205ef](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/95aba51e205efac1f4d739857a30fc9d2238c748), [#5436](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5436)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.8.205...v0.8.206\n"
}
